    "Extension of STL for series with **multiple seasonal periods** (e.g., daily data with weekly AND yearly seasonality).\n",
    "\n",
    "$$Y_t = T_t + S_t^{(1)} + S_t^{(2)} + \\ldots + S_t^{(K)} + R_t$$\n",
