    "\n",
    "$$x_{\\sin} = \\sin\\left(\\frac{2\\pi \\cdot v}{\\text{max}}\\right) \\qquad x_{\\cos} = \\cos\\left(\\frac{2\\pi \\cdot v}{\\text{max}}\\right)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Now December (sin, cos) and January (sin, cos) are **close** in the 2D sin-cos space.\n",
